.Dd May 29, 2026
.Dt AI-QUERY 1
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm ai-query
.Nd guarded one-shot local inference
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar options
.Ar prompt
.Nm
.Op Ar options
.Ar task
.Aq Pa input
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
sends prompts or piped data to the configured local AI endpoint. Safe modes
wrap stdin as untrusted data and apply prompt-injection risk checks.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Fl
.It Fl -mode Ar mode
Select safe-extract, raw, summarize-untrusted, classify-risk, or inspect-prompt-injection.
.It Fl -model Ar name
Model alias.
.It Fl -endpoint Ar url
Server base URL.
.It Fl -max-bytes Ar n
Hard input ceiling.
.It Fl -timeout Ar n
Transport timeout.
.It Fl -think
Enable Qwen3 thinking mode.
.It Fl -show-risk
Print scan findings.
.It Fl -block-high
Exit 4 on high-risk input.
.It Fl -no-wrap
Alias for raw mode.
.It Fl -system Ar text
Override system prompt in raw mode.
.It Fl -json
Emit response metadata as JSON.
.It Fl -audit
Enable metadata-only audit log.
.It Fl -debug
Verbose diagnostics.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show usage.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width AIQ_DEFAULT_MODE
.It Ev ZDOTS_AI_ENDPOINT
Server base URL.
.It Ev ZDOTS_AI_MODEL
Model alias.
.It Ev AIQ_DEFAULT_MODE
Default mode.
.It Ev AIQ_MAX_BYTES , Ev AIQ_WARN_BYTES
Input size limits.
.It Ev AIQ_AUDIT_LOG
Enable metadata-only audit logging.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width 7
.It 0
Success.
.It 1
General failure.
.It 2
Usage error.
.It 3
Input too large.
.It 4
Blocked high-risk input.
.It 5
Transport failure.
.It 6
Malformed server response.
.It 7
Missing dependency.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr zdots-ask 1 ,
.Xr zdots-ai-stack 7 ,
.Xr zdots-phi-safety 7
